The :class:`~peat.modules.schneider.m340.m340.M340` module can now parse ``.sta`` (archived application) and ``.stu`` (project) files saved by Unity Pro or EcoStruxure Control Expert. Both are ZIP archives containing the project file (``BinAppli/Station.apx``), which PEAT extracts and parses like a ``.apx`` file. A STU file only contains it if the project has been built. Thanks to `apxutil <https://github.com/finngineering/apxutil>`_ for documenting the format.
